      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1729211889321,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Issues:\n\nModelDescr is a semi validated object, we \ndon't know if it is tested or not.\n\nIt is semi validated, because we checked if files\nexist or axes of test tensors matches the ones\nfrom the tensor descriptors, but we haven't\nactually run the model.\n\nIf PredictionPipeline was the source of truth,\nwe wouldn't have a semi validated ModelDescr,\nwhich acts as a seriliazed version \nof the PredictionPipeline.\n\nI just want to run the model, why do I need the\ntest tensors?\n\nThe PredictionPipeline, shouldn't get the ModelDescr,\nbecause this dependency is carrying the test data\nall along.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Issues:\n\nModelDescr is a semi validated object, we \ndon't know if it is tested or not.\n\nIt is semi validated, because we checked if files\nexist or axes of test tensors matches the ones\nfrom the tensor descriptors, but we haven't\nactually run the model.\n\nIf PredictionPipeline was the source of truth,\nwe wouldn't have a semi validated ModelDescr,\nwhich acts as a seriliazed version \nof the PredictionPipeline.\n\nI just want to run the model, why do I need the\ntest tensors?\n\nThe PredictionPipeline, shouldn't get the ModelDescr,\nbecause this dependency is carrying the test data\nall along.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
